  "promotion": {
    "state": "withheld",
    "reason": "Pending since 2026-09-11: not yet proven as offered, because it ran from a binary built before its manifest moved it off MySQL 8, which cannot keep data on a Windows host folder. Qualification stopped when D: ran out of space; resume with qualify_batch --offered once it is compacted."
